      "created_at": "2015-12-11T14:56:03.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Often during multiplayer matches, I experience a lot of reconnecting during the game, as well as for others. Has anyone else seen this become a problem as well? I know I don't have the best internet in the world, but it's stable during most online games. This one in particular is the worst about connectivity, oddly enough. It also leaves people wondering if the leaver is returning, or their computer crashed or something. So it can put the game state into limbo at times. It's probably the only complaint I have about multiplayer, besides possibly being locked into game preferences as soon as the game starts (not being able to change the ability to view hands/voting system).</p>",
